 "remarks": "A Frazier Peters masterpiece awaits its next steward on a private two-acre sanctuary in New Canaan. Enchanting stone steps lead the way to this magical home, where a great room with a soaring cathedral ceiling and large wood burning fireplace anchors the residence - flanked on one side by effortless entertaining spaces including a gourmet kitchen, formal dining room, and wet bar, as well as the private primary suite, and on the other by three additional bedrooms, a dedicated office, and two full baths. A sunroom bathes the home in natural light, offering a serene retreat to take in the lush, private grounds. Full of timeless character, architectural provenance, and enduring construction quality, this rare offering is ripe for re-imagination by someone ready to put their own stamp on something truly special.",
